      "scenarioHeading": "WIRELESS - {ScenarioId}",
      "intro": "The WAP mounts on the Guest Lounge ceiling and lands on a spare switchport in the {ReceptionVlanName} VLAN. Configure it from IT1's browser at its management IP.",
